    titleEs: 'Kit Híbrido Finnie-Hutchings (Nicho Alimentación Ciclones)',
    titleEn: 'Finnie-Hutchings Hybrid Kit (Cyclone Feed Niche)',
    partsEs: 'Impulsor cerrado Alto Cromo 27% (A05 ≥650 HB, rasante α ≤ 25°) + Revestimientos Hule Natural R55 FPL/CPL (55 Shore A, impacto cuasi-normal α = 75°–90°).',
    partsEn: '27% High Chrome Closed Impeller (A05 ≥650 HB, leading-edge grazing shear α ≤ 25°) + Split R55 Natural Rubber Liners FPL/CPL (55 Shore A, quasi-normal impact α = 75°–90°).',
    envEs: 'Alimentación mixta a ciclones d₈₀ = 150–400 µm, u₂ ≤ 24.5 m/s, -28% reducción de masa y maniobra ergonómica.',
    envEn: 'Mixed cyclone feed d₈₀ = 150–400 µm, u₂ ≤ 24.5 m/s, -28% mass reduction & ergonomic rigging.',
